  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Original Gain Train",
    "overview": "The owner prefers the original Gain Train visual system and requested its restoration while retaining quality-of-life improvements and bug fixes. Blue actions, navy text, light-grey backgrounds, rounded cards and the Gain Train header define that system. Home retains its original heading and date treatment.\n\nVisual authority is the [original GitHub Pages app](https://antonj997.github.io/gain-train-pwa/) and [repository commit 3d2514862f7babecb964eb01b09230d804b86e77](https://github.com/antonj997/gain-train-pwa/tree/3d2514862f7babecb964eb01b09230d804b86e77). The restored `src/index.css` and six public icons come from that commit: `public/icon.svg`, `public/icon-192.png`, `public/icon-512.png`, `public/icon-maskable.png`, `public/apple-touch-icon.png` and `public/favicon.ico`. The supplied `public/icon-license.txt` credits Lucide/Feather contributors. Preserve these assets and their license.\n\nCurrent implementation sources are `src/index.css`, `src/styles/usability.css`, the scoped set-editing, profile and history-calendar stylesheets, and `tailwind.config.ts`. The usability stylesheet loads after the original stylesheet; scoped additions inherit the original visual system.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Blue actions and links with light and dark neutral surfaces.",
      "Rounded, bordered cards and touch-friendly controls.",
      "Familiar brand header, fixed bottom navigation and animated day/night switch.",
      "Quality-of-life additions that inherit the original tokens."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the original Gain Train palette, rounded containers, header, navigation, theme switch and identity assets.",
      "**Do** style quality-of-life controls in `src/styles/usability.css` or their existing scoped stylesheets using the incumbent tokens.",
      "**Do** retain clear save status, direct load/measurement controls, planned-routine fields and readable completed data."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** reintroduce the Training Ledger palette, flattened exercise layout or restrained-corner redesign; the owner rejected that visual direction.",
      "**Don't** replace the restored identity assets or add a new visual identity without a new user request.",
      "**Don't** let compact editing hide real field errors or replace historical Save/Discard behavior."
    ]
  }
}
